  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help us Send Instruments to Talented Students!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MFW provides free virtual music education to vulnerable communities worldwide. Throughout our journey, we have witnessed the struggles faced by many talented students around the world, many of whom don&apos;t own an instrument, and can&apos;t afford one of their own. Some of these students live in locations where music instruments are out of reach.  Your donation will help with buying musical instruments that are not usually donated, and cover all incurring costs of handling and shipping.</narrative>
  </description>
